er","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-01-08T16:27:21Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T15:38:29Z","closed_at":"2026-02-05T15:38:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.6.beta3.official [76dda5c6c]\n\nDid not try any other versions\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21037.1004) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-11400F @ 2.60GHz (12 threads) - 15.86 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nSkeleton3D node edit mode has a lot of issues and flaws\n\nYou cannot select a bone in transform mode, only in select mode, that adds frustrating necessity to change modes\nBone button's hitbox is too small, it's even smaller than its icon\nThere is no undo/redo after you transform bone\n\nAlso, I think it should unselect Skeleton3D node if you clicked past AABB boundaries\n\nAlso, maybe there should be Insert Key that is only adding tracks for changed transform bones, or just that adds tracks for selected bone\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSelect Skeleton3D node\nTurn on edit mode\nTry selecting any bone in transform mode (It does not work)\nTry selecting any bone in select mode, notice how hard it is to select a bone\nGo back to transform mode\nTransform bone in anyway\nTry undoing that transform (It does not work)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[skeleton-3d-edit-mode.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24498942/skeleton-3d-edit-mode.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114749/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114749/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}